          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Significant reductions in global diesel tied to the Russia–Ukraine war raise the strategic importance of Gulf supply lines for dependent states, increasing political and military momentum to undertake coercive or kinetic retaliation after attacks on shipping or infrastructure to secure flows." />
