          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained increases in diesel (refined product) prices widen refinery margins and prompt higher crude demand expectations, which transmits upward pressure to crude oil benchmark prices via market repricing and refinery crude buying." />
