          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained increases in global diesel prices raise operational and logistics costs for compute‑intensive AI infrastructure (generators, transport, edge deployments), reducing projected returns and causing some investors to delay or withdraw capital from AI projects in exposed markets." />
