          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sharp, sustained oil-price spikes tied to Gulf disruptions increase domestic economic pain and political pressure on governments to secure energy flows, thereby strengthening calls for military action or coercive measures to restore supplies." />
